      ],
      "title": "#1 神秘流水线"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3119001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "谁谁谁谁是水水水水水……这个字怎怎怎么念？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "……关。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "谁谁谁谁是水水水水关，和和和桃桃桃桃桃桃土丝，站站站站出来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "我的名字叫水咲，果然是个笨蛋。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "你你你你骂谁谁谁呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "骂的就是你，还要我再说一遍么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "哟，挺硬气的嘛，你是水咲，她想必就是桃乐丝了，对吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "你、你们想干什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "不干什么，我们想请你们两个走一趟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "……去哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "一个“好”地方。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "我拒绝。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "没关系，没关系，没关系。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "你们有权拒绝，我们呢也不是非要——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "用平和的方式解决问题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "你们这是什么意思？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119019",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "没什么意思，带走她们！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "好好好好好的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119021",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "呀！——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "哇啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "水咲！桃乐丝！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119024",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "水咲姐姐！桃乐丝姐姐！放开她们，你们这些坏蛋！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "呜呜呜呜呜呜……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "樱，不要太难过了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "呜哇哇哇哇哇哇哇哇哇哇……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "呜……水咲姐姐……桃乐丝姐姐……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "呜呜呜……她们被坏蛋抓走了……会不会有危险……呜呜……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "呜呜……樱要……樱要去找水咲姐姐和桃乐丝姐姐……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不可以，这太危险了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "呜呜呜……樱不管嘛……樱就要去找她们……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我们可以替你去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "诶……真的……可以吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你要答应我们乖乖待在这里，等我们回来，不可以随意乱跑，能做到吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "樱可以的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "好，优纪，我们追上去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3119039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-145",
