      ],
      "title": "#2 残酷的分离"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3120001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "你们要把我们带到哪去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "到了到了，总算可以交差了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "这是什么地方……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "这……这是……天哪……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "跟到这里就失去她们的身影了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "怎么办，还要往前走吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江，你在想什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "这座建筑，上次来这里的时候，优纪就是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "什么？我怎么了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不，没什么，我的意思是我们可以到别……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "啊啊啊~~~~！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这是水咲的声音！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是从这座建筑里传出来的，我们赶快进去看看！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120016",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "我不要我不要我不要！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "我不要进去！！！放开我！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "为什么要拒绝？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "只要进了这个流水线，你就可以体会——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "这个世界上最美妙的神秘涂料哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120021",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "我不要，放我出去！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "到了这个地步，你以为自己还有选择的权利么！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "给我进去吧！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120024",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "啊~~~~~！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120025",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "水咲！——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "怎么？你很担心你的同伴？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "你也一起进去怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "不……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "你在发抖啊……你不想和那个家伙在一起吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "你也给我进去~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120032",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "呀！~~~~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哈啊……哈啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "水咲……桃乐丝……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我们……还是来晚了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120036",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "吼吼吼吼~~~~~！！！！！啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这……这是怎么了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120038",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊~~~~~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3120039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-146",
