      "title": "#3 可怕的灾难"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3121001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "她们似乎……失去了神智……被狂化了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "水咲和桃乐丝怎么会变成这样……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我猜测应该与那个神秘涂料有很大的关联。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这个神秘涂料……果然那个狩猎者在撒谎！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "快快！摁住她俩，别让她们趁机溜出这里！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小坦克",
          "text": "可、可是……她们的力气突然变得好大~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121007",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "吼吼吼吼~~~~~！！！！！啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊~~~~~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小坦克",
          "text": "哎呦，好痛~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小手雷",
          "text": "我、我不敢靠近她们……呜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "你们……给我滚开！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "吼吼吼吼~~~~~！！！！！啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "吼吼……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "这样不就行了么，麻溜地学着点！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小坦克",
          "text": "是、是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "它们把水咲和桃乐丝装进快递箱子了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那个箱子怎么看着这么眼熟？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可恶……看不清楚！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪，等等……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这里原来……有这么多被密封好的箱子……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "什么？！这个地址居然是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3121022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪！快躲起来，它们过来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-147",
