      "title": "#4 天启的真面目"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3122001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "天启打算……怎么处置水咲和桃乐丝……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "优纪，你……冷静一点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "该怎么冷静呢……发生了这样的事……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "明明在不久前……她们还那么鲜活地站在我们面前……对着我们谈笑……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我决定了……我要救她们！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我明白你的心情，但是你要知道……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江……我知道我们不一样……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你总是那么沉着冷静……头脑也比我聪明得多……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "但是我们都有属于自己的成长方式……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我会选择帮助这些被狂化的手办……哪怕付出我的一切……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪！我不允许你伤害自己！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我知道的……和江……我一直都知道……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你对我很好很好……有时候比主人还要关心我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可我……无法放任这些无助的狂化手办不管……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "否则……否则……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "每一次陪伴在主人身边的幸福，都会让我深深地惶恐……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我知道了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你、你要走了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不，我会留下来，和你一起救下这些被狂化的手办。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3122022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江……果然！这个世界上除了主人，优纪最最喜欢你了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-148",
      "sourceRefs": [
