      "title": "#5 阻止天启"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3123001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "没能顺利带回水咲和桃乐丝……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我、我不知道怎么面对樱……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "没关系的，有我在，不会让你独自面对。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可是……樱如果知道水咲和桃乐丝变成那个样子……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "会不会……会不会被吓到呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那就，暂时不把这些细节告诉樱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "只……只能这样了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔，对不起哦，樱，优纪姐姐不是故意骗你的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123009",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……优纪，你太温柔了。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "樱，我们回来了，有没有趁我们不在偷偷哭鼻子呀~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "诶？樱……不在吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "会去哪里呢……不是告诉过她不要乱跑，乖乖在这里等我们回来的吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "会不会……被天启那些马仔带走了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "绝无可能，我们一路从那里回来，不可能没有发现樱的身影。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不要吓自己，先四处找找看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯……好、好的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那边我都找过了，没有看到樱……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你那边呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……也没有。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "怎么会……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "还有一个地方，我们过去看看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "樱，你要乖乖听话，我们很快就好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "这是什么呀？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "是一种……一种为手办定制的、很甜很甜的饮料。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "很甜很甜嘛？快让樱尝尝看~!",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "——给。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "不对，你是坏蛋，把优纪姐姐、和江姐姐骗进来的坏蛋，樱不要相信你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "可是，这个饮料真的很甜很甜很甜哦，樱真的不要尝尝吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "嗯…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123033",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "一小口没关系的吧，嗯，优纪姐姐、和江姐姐不会生气的~",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "那，就一小口哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "莉可，放开樱！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "尤娜……姐姐……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123037",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "哇呀呀呀呀呀~！！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "樱，你、你怎么了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "姐姐小心~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "找到樱了~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3123041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "等等，她看起来不太对……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "樱这是怎么了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "这个症状……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148003",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "吼吼吼~！！！！吼吼啊啊啊啊~~！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "樱！——你不认识我了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "我是你的尤娜姐姐啊~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "杀……杀……杀……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "樱她……也被狂化了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "怎么会这样……怎么和狩猎者说的不一样……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "杀……杀……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "樱……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "应是极度透支所致。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "呜…………对不起，博士，我没有看护好樱……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "如果樱不能恢复从前的样子怎么办……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "姐姐，这不是你的错……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "也许，我们可以想想办法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "是什么……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我们认识一位擅长手办修复的同伴，可以把樱带到她那里去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "好，为了樱，就算是万分之一的可能我都会去尝试！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3148020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "事不宜迟，我们现在就出发吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
